  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Requires `Alpaca.Markets` 8.0.0.\n- BREAKING: The `CalendarExtensions` type was removed (`AsExclusiveTimeIntervalUtc`, `AsInclusiveTimeIntervalUtc`, `AsIntervalUtc`). Use `IIntervalCalendar` from the core SDK.\n- BREAKING: `GetCalendarForSingleDayAsync` now takes `DateOnly` and returns `IIntervalCalendar?` instead of `DateTime` / `ICalendar?`.\n- BREAKING: `GetAverageDailyTradeVolumeAsync` overloads that took `DateTime` or `IInclusiveTimeInterval` were removed. Use the `DateOnly` / `Interval<DateOnly>` overloads.\n- Target frameworks are now `netstandard2.0`, `netstandard2.1`, `net462`, `net8.0`, and `net10.0` (`net6.0` was removed).\n- Added `GetOrderImbalanceSubscription` and `SubscribeOrderImbalanceAsync` helpers on `IAlpacaDataStreamingClient`.\n- All dependencies were updated to the latest stable versions.",
